@startuml hld_direct_command_oem_to_can_seq
title __HLD — Remote Direct Command: OEM Server → CAN
!pragma teoz true

autonumber

actor "<b>OEM Server\n<b>(Cloud)" as OEM #FFF8E1

box "<<container>>\n       EP" #LightYellow
    participant "<b>MQTTMgr" as MQTTSVC #APPLICATION
    box "RemoteDiagProxy" #LightYellow
        participant "<b>MqttMgrAdapter" as EP_MQTT #APPLICATION
        participant "<b>ProxyIpcClient" as EP_IPC #APPLICATION
    endbox
endbox

box "<<container>>\n       IP" #LightYellow
    box "    <<app>>\nRemoteDiag" #LightYellow
        participant "<b>ProxyIpcServer\n<b>+ CallbackHandler" as IP_IPC #APPLICATION
        participant "<b>Remotediag" as RDGCORE #APPLICATION
        participant "<b>RemoteDirect\n<b>Command" as DIRCMD #APPLICATION
        participant "<b>Onboardclient\n<b>Adapter" as IP_OBC #APPLICATION
    endbox
    participant "<b>Onboardclient\n<b>ManagerService\n<b>(OnBoardClient)" as OBCSVC #APPLICATION
    participant "<b>Communication\n<b>ManagerService" as COMMGR #C5CAE9
endbox

participant "<b>MCU Gateway" as MCU #CFD8DC
participant "<b>CAN Bus\n<b>(Target ECUs)" as CAN #CFD8DC

== Receive direct command from OEM Server ==
OEM -> MQTTSVC: MQTT publish\n(direct command notification)
MQTTSVC -> EP_MQTT: onNotifyReceived(message)
EP_MQTT -> EP_IPC: sendCallback(MqttOnNotifyReceived, payload)

' == Forward EP → IP via Unix Domain Socket ==
EP_IPC -> IP_IPC: <b>Unix-Socket</b> callback frame\n(MqttOnNotifyReceived)

' == Processing in RemoteDiag ==
IP_IPC -> RDGCORE: MSG_CENTER_PUSH_RECEIVED\n→ CenterReqData
RDGCORE -> DIRCMD: onCenterCommandForward\n(MSG_ID_CENTERREQUESTDIRECTCOMMAND)
DIRCMD -> DIRCMD: triggerDirectCommand()\n(PriorityControl arbitration,\nDiagTrigger::DIRECT_COMMAND)

== Filter & Validate Command ==
DIRCMD -> DIRCMD: sendDirectCommand()\nduyệt từng DirectCommand trong request
DIRCMD -> DIRCMD: validateDirectCommand(cmd, ecuInfo)\n(đối chiếu EcuInformation:\nprotocol / target address)
DIRCMD -> DIRCMD: <b>SidFilter::isAllowed(udsReq)</b>\n(chặn UDS reprogramming SID)\n+ check size (0 < size ≤ 4095B)

alt Filtered (SID blocked / incorrect size / ECU invalid)
    DIRCMD -> DIRCMD: mark error\nSC_COMMAND_ERROR\n→ add to upload data\n(not sent to CAN)
else Valid
    == Send UDS to CAN via OnBoardClient ==
    DIRCMD -> IP_OBC: connect(transportInfo)\n+ sendUdsData(connectId, uds)
    IP_OBC -> OBCSVC: Binder IPC\nIOnboardclientManagerService\n::sendUdsData(connectId, udsRequest)
    OBCSVC -> COMMGR: Binder IPC\nsendDataToMcu(commData)
    COMMGR -> MCU: AP–MCU bus\n(commData)
    MCU -> CAN: CAN frame (UDS request)
end

== Response (chiều ngược) ==
CAN --> MCU: UDS response
MCU --> COMMGR: response commData
COMMGR --> OBCSVC: CommunicationReceiver\n::onReceive
OBCSVC --> IP_OBC: Binder callback\nonResponseEvent
IP_OBC --> DIRCMD: UDS response
DIRCMD --> DIRCMD: gom kết quả →\nUploadManager (upload về OEM)

note over EP_IPC, IP_IPC #White
Đường EP ↔ IP duy nhất là Unix Domain Socket
(callback: EP → IP). Đường UDS xuống OBC đi
Binder trực tiếp trong IP, không qua proxy.
end note

note over DIRCMD #White
Filter 2 lớp trước khi gửi CAN:
1. validateDirectCommand — ECU hợp lệ
2. SidFilter — chặn reprogramming SID
Command bị chặn vẫn upload về OEM
với status SC_COMMAND_ERROR.
end note

@enduml
